==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~9.33 seconds<sup>60f~280f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.07~10.67 seconds<sup>2f~320f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~8 seconds<sup>20f~240f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

